{%- comment -%}
  Card variant 3/3 (sections/5dla_collection-product-grid.liquid's
  `product_card_type` setting picks between 5dla_product-card-1/2/3).
  Ported 1:1 (markup + CSS) from the reference's `article.product-card`
  inside `section#shop` (html/revamp-collection/rendered/Fusion Tri
  Suits for Hot-Weather Racing....html).

  `c5dla-card-3` on the root element is this variant's CSS prefix (see
  client/ver_2_0/scss/collection/_product-card-3.scss), same convention
  as card 1/2.

  Font: same reference page as card 2, same `--body: "Jost", Arial,
  sans-serif` - the Google Fonts <link> in
  sections/5dla_collection-product-grid.liquid is shared by both
  (gated on `product_card_type == 'card_2' or 'card_3'`).

  Data mapping (per request):
  - store-product-category: the CURRENT collection (collection.title/.url),
    not "All" like the reference's own link.
  - store-product-review: product.metafields.judgeme.badge, wrapped in the
    same `.jdgm-widget.jdgm-preview-badge[data-id]` hook used elsewhere in
    this theme (snippets/product-grid-hover-1.liquid) - Judge.me's own app
    script (not part of this stack) hydrates it wherever that hook appears.
  - product-title-row: product.title, linked to product.url.
  - store-product-vendor: product.vendor. The reference links it to a
    static brand page; no per-vendor page mapping was specified, so this
    links to a best-effort `/pages/<handleized vendor>` guess (same
    fallback-link pattern as sections/5dla_collection-benefits.liquid).
  - store-product-price: current_variant.price (a VARIANT price, matching
    card 2's convention, not a product-level range).
  - store-product-badge (image overlay, not in the mapping list but part
    of "migrate article.product-card") reuses the same
    product.metafields.bwp_fields.badge_label as card 2, for consistency.
  - product-swatches: snippets/5dla_product-card-3-swatches.liquid (new) -
    its own markup/CSS, not shared with card 1's
    snippets/5dla_product-card-1-swatches.liquid (different shape: flat
    dot vs. this card's ring+dot).
  - size-selector: snippets/5dla_product-size-selector.liquid (new).
  - Add to cart: snippets/5dla_product-card-3-actions.liquid (new).

  Variant switching (client/ver_2_0/js/variant.js, wired up by
  client/ver_2_0/js/collection.js): `data-variant-picker` +
  `data-current-variant-id` on the root <article> are variant.js's entry
  point into this card. Every element whose content depends on the
  SELECTED variant (not just the product) carries a `dynamic="<key>"`
  attribute so variant.js can find and update it without re-rendering the
  whole card:
  - dynamic="product-title": re-set to product.title on every variant
    change (title is product-level, not variant-level, so this is a
    no-op in practice - kept for a consistent "every dynamic field gets
    refreshed" routine, and in case a future card wants variant.title/
    public_title here instead).
  - dynamic="product-price": current_variant.price, formatted client-side
    via the sitewide money format (assets/currencies.js's
    `Currency.formatMoney` + wpbingo.strings.moneyFormat, already loaded
    by snippets/footer-javascript(-optimized).liquid - not reimplemented
    here).
  - dynamic="product-image": swapped ONLY when the newly selected variant's
    COLOR differs from the previous selection (per request) - a plain size
    change never touches it.
  - dynamic="quick-view-trigger" (quick-view-button's own `data-variant-id`)
    and dynamic="variant-id-input" (the hidden `id` input in
    snippets/5dla_product-card-3-actions.liquid) - kept pointed at the
    selected variant so quick view/add-to-cart always target it, not the
    page-load default.

  Expects: product, swatch_limit, size_limit (section.settings.size_selector_limit,
  passed through to snippets/5dla_product-size-selector.liquid)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign current_media = current_variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_media
  assign badge_label = product.metafields.bwp_fields.badge_label
  assign review_badge = product.metafields.judgeme.badge
-%}

<article
  class="product-card c5dla-card-3"
  data-product-json="{{ product | json | escape }}"
  data-product-handle="{{ product.handle | escape }}"
  data-variant-picker
  data-current-variant-id="{{ current_variant.id }}"
>
  <div class="product-image-box">
    {%- if current_media -%}
      <img
        dynamic="product-image"
        src="{{ current_media | image_url: width: 960 }}"
        alt="{{ current_media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="960"
        height="{{ 960 | divided_by: current_media.aspect_ratio }}"
      >
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if badge_label != blank -%}
      <span class="store-product-badge">{{ badge_label }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <button
      class="quick-view-button"
      type="button"
      dynamic="quick-view-trigger"
      data-handle="{{ product.handle }}"
      data-variant-id="{{ current_variant.id }}"
    >
      {{ 'products.product.quickview' | t }}
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="product-info">
    <a class="store-product-category" href="{{ collection.url }}">{{ collection.title }}</a>
    {%- if review_badge != blank -%}
      <span class="store-product-review jdgm-widget jdgm-preview-badge" data-id="{{ product.id }}">
        {{ review_badge }}
      </span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="product-title-row">
      <h3>
        <a href="{{ product.url }}"><span dynamic="product-title">{{ product.title }}</span></a>
      </h3>
    </div>
    {%- if product.vendor != blank -%}
      {%- assign vendor_handle = product.vendor | handleize -%}
      <a class="store-product-vendor" href="{{ pages[vendor_handle].url | default: '#' }}">
        {{ product.vendor }}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span class="store-product-price" dynamic="product-price">{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>

    {%- render '5dla_product-card-3-swatches',
      product: product,
      swatch_limit: swatch_limit,
      current_variant: current_variant
    -%}

    {%- render '5dla_product-size-selector',
      product: product,
      current_variant: current_variant,
      size_limit: size_limit
    -%}
    {%- render '5dla_product-card-3-actions', product: product, current_variant: current_variant -%}
    <p class="availability-note">Confirm size and availability at checkout.</p>
  </div>
</article>
